    rcap:evidencePosition "lead_in:1" ;
    rcap:evidenceSection "8.3.4" ;
    rcap:evidenceText "If, at any time after reveal of allocation, there is confirmed diagnosis (or a strong clinical suspicion) of legionellosis or other microbiological diagnosis of an ‘atypical’ organism, then effective treatment for ‘atypical’ organisms must be provided." ;
    rcap:occurrenceKind "intervention" .

